### 5.2 文件上传实现

**UploadAvatarAsync 实现**：
```csharp
public async Task<Response<UploadAvatarResponse>> UploadAvatarAsync(
    Stream fileStream, 
    string fileName, 
    CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)
{
    try
    {
        var content = new MultipartFormDataContent
        {
            { new StreamContent(fileStream), "file", fileName }
        };

        var response = await _baseUrl
            .AppendPathSegments(["api", "sysFile", "uploadAvatar"])
            .WithHeader("Token", _token)
            .PostAsync(content, cancellationToken);

        return await response.GetJsonAsync<Response<UploadAvatarResponse>>();
    }
    catch (FlurlHttpException e)
    {
        throw await ReThrowAsync(e);
    }
}
```

### 5.3 验证码图片显示

**技术方案**：
1. 后端返回 Base64 编码的图片数据
2. 前端解码显示
3. 点击刷新重新获取

**LoginViewModel 扩展**：
```csharp
[ObservableProperty]
private ImageSource? _captchaImage;

[ObservableProperty]
private string _captchaCode = string.Empty;

[ObservableProperty]
private string _captchaCodeId = string.Empty;

[RelayCommand]
private async Task LoadCaptchaAsync()
{
    try
    {
        var response = await _apiClient.GetCaptchaAsync();
        CaptchaCodeId = response.Data.CodeId;

        // 解码 Base64 图片
        var imageBytes = Convert.FromBase64String(response.Data.ImageData);
        using var stream = new MemoryStream(imageBytes);
        var bitmap = new BitmapImage();
        bitmap.BeginInit();
        bitmap.StreamSource = stream;
        bitmap.CacheOption = BitmapCacheOption.OnLoad;
        bitmap.EndInit();
        bitmap.Freeze();

        CaptchaImage = bitmap;
    }
    catch (Exception ex)
    {
        ErrorMessage = $"加载验证码失败: {ex.Message}";
    }
}
```
